        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bashimapepo bekalakumya citumbi ca muntu, pantu kuti balaikowesha, kanofye ninshi nga citumbi cakwa wishi nangu nyina, atemwa ica mwana wabo umwaume nangu mwanakashi, atemwa ica bamunyinabo nangu ica bankashi yabo abashaupwa, lyena kuti baikowesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga umo aikowesha mu nshila iyi, ali nokusangululwa. Nga apwa ukusangululwa, pali nokupita inshiku cine lubali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "elyo ninshi aye mu lubansa lwa mwilinga lyamukati umwaba iŋanda yandi. Atuule no mutuulo wakwe uwakwelelwa pa bubifi, awe ninshi lyena kuti alabomba imilimo nakabili mu ŋanda yandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
