            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Pa bena Israeli ni bashimapepofye beka ebashalekwatako impanga iyakuba icikwatwa cabo. Ne cikwatwa cabo nine winefye ne Lesa. Belapeelwako icuma icakuti baleikwatila, ne mwine wine nine nakulaba icuma cabo icakuti baleikwatila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imituulo ya cabunga, ne mituulo iyakwelelwa pa bubifi, ne mituulo iyakufuta pa bubifi eyakulaba ifyakulya fya bashimapepo, kabili ebali nokulabuula ifintu fyonse ifyo abantu bakulampatwila mu calo ca Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bashimapepo ebakulabuula ifisabo fyonse ifyakubalilapo ifyawamisha, ne fintu fyonse ifyakulatuulwa kuli ine. Bali nokulapeelako bashimapepo ubunga ubwapeleka ubwakubalilapo, epakuti ipaalo lyandi lileba mu mayanda yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bashimapepo belalyako cuni icaifwila, nangufye inama iyaifwila, atemwa iyaipaiwa ne nama inankwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
